README for mesh/k-ellipse folder

	Please try create a Makefile to automate your work
		(it also serves to document the actions needed to
		compile and run your programs)
	
	Please use command line arguments in your main program
		(as many as you like, and they can be incrementally added).
		The Makefile should have a variable 
		for each of the command line arguments,
		with reasonable default values.
	
	Create targets for basic examples (eg1, eg2, etc). 

	There are several Makefile styles used in Core Library:
		you can copy one from the other folders

	Feel free to ask me!
	--Chee Yap, July 2021


